# The browser no longer uses any secrets — the Sanity token and admin password
# now live on the SERVER (Cloudflare Pages Functions), not in this file.
#
# Set these in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   Workers & Pages -> (your project) -> Settings -> Environment variables
#
#   SANITY_TOKEN      = a Sanity token with Editor (write) permission
#   ADMIN_PASSWORD    = the password the site owner types to log in
#   SANITY_PROJECT_ID = s42jv3ts   (optional, this is the default)
#   SANITY_DATASET    = production  (optional, this is the default)
#
# For local testing with `npx wrangler pages dev`, put the same values in a
# file named `.dev.vars` (see .dev.vars.example).
